      "why": "Registering every m stages (m=2..4) cuts FF count and area vs fully pipelined while still giving 1 result/cycle. Latency ceil(N/m)+2 must stay small enough that 32 back-to-back results finish within 0.5 us of the tick; m=2..4 keeps latency <= ~10 cycles, which at Fmax >= 64 MHz fits the 0.5 us batch window."
    }
